# `npm run format` deliberately covers only the TypeScript under src/ and
# tests/. Everything listed here is either hand-written prose or generated
# output, and an editor's format-on-save must not rewrite it: Prettier
# reflows the docs and mangles the Kramdown `{:toc}` directive they rely on,
# and the example HTML is produced by `ifc`, not by hand.
*.md
docs/
examples/**/*.html
dist/
